{"seq":1,"slug":"compound-interest-of-knowledge","title":"知识的复利","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/ideas-and-methods/style-of-thinking/compound-interest-of-knowledge","wordCount":1344,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"知识的复利\">知识的复利</h1><p>汉明把「持续投入」类比成<strong>复利</strong>：知识和努力像本金一样滚动增长，每天多一点的差距，长期会拉开惊人的鸿沟。这是《你和你的研究》中最具数学美感的论断（<a href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/science/1986-hamming\">gwern.net 转录</a>）。本篇讲「时间维度上的积累策略」；空间维度上的开放交流见兄弟篇 <a href=\"open-door-vs-closed-door\"><code>2_open-door-vs-closed-door.md</code></a>，二者互补不重复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>&quot;知识复利&quot;是这篇演讲里最有数学质感的论断，它由三个概念构成：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>线性的努力差制造指数的成就差</strong>：积累服从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = A_0(1+r)^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。两个人每期只差 1 个百分点，40 年后差距可达数十倍。</li>\n<li><strong>滚动的是可叠加资产，不只是工时</strong>：真正进入复利轨道的本金是知识、工具与方法、声誉与人脉。判据是&quot;可叠加性&quot;——今天的产出能否成为明天的输入；不能叠加的努力是单利。</li>\n<li><strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>（期数）要求专注，而专注需要与开放配对</strong>：频繁换向会把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 清零、本金折损，所以汉明的平衡是&quot;专注于领域，开放于信息&quot;。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"复利的原话与数学\">复利的原话与数学</h2><p>汉明的原话是：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>「知识与生产力就像复利。在两个能力差不多的人之间，如果一个人比另一个多干 10%，他终生产出的不是多 10%，而是多一倍以上。」（<a href=\"https://gwern.net/doc/science/1986-hamming\">gwern.net 转录</a>）</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>把它写成模型就一目了然。设每期相对增长为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>，经 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 期后的积累为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = A_0 (1 + r)^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>两人初始相同 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，一人 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=0.10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.10</span></span></span></span></span>、另一人 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.11</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=0.11</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.11</span></span></span></span></span>（每期多努力 1 个百分点），看 40 年：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>期数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=0.10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.10</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.11</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=0.11</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.11</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>领先者 / 落后者</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1.10</td>\n<td>1.11</td>\n<td>1.01×</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10</td>\n<td>2.59</td>\n<td>2.84</td>\n<td>1.10×</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>6.73</td>\n<td>8.06</td>\n<td>1.20×</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>40</td>\n<td>45.3</td>\n<td>65.0</td>\n<td><strong>1.44×</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把差距拉到汉明说的「多干 10%」（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=0.10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.10</span></span></span></span></span> vs <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=0.20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.20</span></span></span></span></span>），40 年后比值是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>1.20</mn><mn>40</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mn>1.10</mn><mn>40</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>33</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.20^{40}/1.10^{40}\\approx 33</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">40</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/1.1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">40</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">33</span></span></span></span></span> 倍。<strong>线性的努力差，制造指数的成就差</strong>——这正是「多 10% 努力 → 多一倍以上产出」的数学根据。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"xychart\" data-source=\"xychart-beta&#10;    title &quot;复利:每期多努力一点,长期差距爆炸&quot;&#10;    x-axis &quot;年&quot; [0, 10, 20, 30, 40]&#10;    y-axis &quot;累计积累&quot; 0 --&gt; 70&#10;    line [1, 2.59, 6.73, 17.4, 45.3]&#10;    line [1, 2.84, 8.06, 22.9, 65.0]\">xychart-beta\n    title \"复利:每期多努力一点,长期差距爆炸\"\n    x-axis \"年\" [0, 10, 20, 30, 40]\n    y-axis \"累计积累\" 0 --&gt; 70\n    line [1, 2.59, 6.73, 17.4, 45.3]\n    line [1, 2.84, 8.06, 22.9, 65.0]</pre><h2 id=\"复利的-本金-是什么\">复利的「本金」是什么</h2><p>汉明强调复利里滚动的不只是工时，更是三样可累积的资产：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>本金类型</th>\n<th>如何复利</th>\n<th>反例（不复利的努力）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>知识</td>\n<td>今天学的成为明天学新东西的台阶</td>\n<td>学完即忘、不成体系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具与方法</td>\n<td>一次造好的工具反复复用、迭代</td>\n<td>每次重新发明轮子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>声誉与人脉</td>\n<td>一个好工作带来下一个机会</td>\n<td>频繁跳题，无人记得你做过什么</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键在于「可叠加性」：只有当今天的产出能成为明天的输入，努力才进入复利轨道。一份份互不相关的工作是<strong>单利</strong>——加总而非相乘。</p>\n<h2 id=\"专注-复利的隐含前提\">专注：复利的隐含前提</h2><p>复利公式里的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>（期数）要求长期不中断，这就要求<strong>专注</strong>。汉明观察到，不断换方向的人无法在任一领域积累到足够深度，因为每次转向都把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 清零、本金折损。他自己长期专注于计算与编码，才让汉明码这样的单点突破之上长出持续的影响（见 <a href=\"../../influence-and-legacy/influence-on-computing/error-correction-everywhere\"><code>../../5_influence-and-legacy/1_influence-on-computing/2_error-correction-everywhere.md</code></a>）。</p>\n<p>但专注与开放交流（<a href=\"open-door-vs-closed-door\"><code>2_open-door-vs-closed-door.md</code></a>）存在张力：太专注会闭门造车，太开放会失焦。汉明的解法是**「专注于领域，开放于信息」**——主攻方向稳定，但持续吸收外部线索来校准这个方向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反模式与权衡\">反模式与权衡</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反模式</th>\n<th>为何破坏复利</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>追新弃旧</td>\n<td>频繁换题让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 归零，永远在付启动成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>忙而不积</td>\n<td>工时很满但产出不叠加，是单利甚至负利</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>透支本金</td>\n<td>用健康/关系换短期产出，复利的「本金」反而缩水</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>权衡要点</strong>：复利的代价是<strong>延迟满足</strong>。前期曲线平缓（看上面表格，前 10 年差距才 1.1 倍），回报集中在后段。很多人在曲线起飞前就放弃或转向，恰恰错过了指数段。汉明的忠告本质是「相信曲线，熬过平缓期」。</p>\n<p><strong>诚实的边界</strong>：复利模型假设增长率稳定，但现实中领域会过时、健康会衰退、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 并非恒定。把它当严格预测会过度自信；它的正确用法是<strong>定性直觉</strong>——提醒你持续微小投入的长期威力，而非精确承诺 33 倍回报。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨领域迁移\">跨领域迁移</h2><p>知识复利是普世的成长模型，适用于学习任何技能、积累任何资产。它也呼应了汉明留给研究文化的长久启示（见 <a href=\"../../influence-and-legacy/influence-on-research-culture/inspiring-researchers\"><code>../../5_influence-and-legacy/2_influence-on-research-culture/1_inspiring-researchers.md</code></a>）：卓越不是某次爆发，而是可叠加的日常被时间放大的结果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>复利模型把汉明的论断量化：每期多努力一点，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1+r)^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的指数效应，长期产出差距远超线性。</li>\n<li>复利滚动的「本金」不只是工时，更是<strong>知识、工具方法、声誉人脉</strong>这三样可叠加资产。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>（期数）要求<strong>专注</strong>，但专注须与开放交流配对，避免在偏题方向上空转复利。</li>\n<li>代价是<strong>延迟满足</strong>：回报集中在曲线后段，多数人在起飞前放弃；模型是定性直觉，不是精确预测。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"知识的复利","id":"知识的复利"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"复利的原话与数学","id":"复利的原话与数学"},{"level":2,"text":"复利的「本金」是什么","id":"复利的-本金-是什么"},{"level":2,"text":"专注：复利的隐含前提","id":"专注-复利的隐含前提"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式与权衡","id":"反模式与权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"跨领域迁移","id":"跨领域迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"勇气与远见","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/ideas-and-methods/the-importance-of-problems/courage-and-vision"},"next":{"title":"开门与关门","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-hamming/ideas-and-methods/style-of-thinking/open-door-vs-closed-door"}}